        {
          "text": "Ikawa, kama baada ya mwezi mmoja, Nahashi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Au hivi, Lakini yeye akanyamaa Kimya, ndipo Nahashi…",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwamoni, akakwea na kupanga marago juu ya Yabesh-gileadi; na watu wote wa Yabeshi wakamwambia Nahashi, Fanya mapatano nasi, na sisi tutakutumikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.34.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwa 34:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Nahashi, Mwamoni, akawaambia, Kwa sharti hii mimi nitapatana nanyi, kila mtu ang’olewe jicho la kuume; na kwa jambo hilo nitawashutumu Waisraeli wote pia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi wazee wa Yabeshi wakamjibu, Tuachie siku saba, ili tutume wajumbe waende mipakani mwote mwa Israeli; kisha, ikiwa hakuna atakayetuokoa, tutakutokea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
