        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo wajumbe wakafika Gibea ya Sauli, wakasema maneno hayo masikioni mwa watu; na watu wote wakainua sauti zao wakalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tazama, Sauli akaja akifuata ng’ombe kutoka kondeni; naye Sauli akauliza, Watu hawa wana nini, hata wakalia? Wakamwambia maneno ya watu wale wa Yabeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
