        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akatwaa jozi ya ng’ombe, akawakata-kata vipande, kisha akavipeleka vile vipande mipakani mwote mwa Israeli kwa mikono ya wajumbe, kusema, Ye yote asiyetoka nyuma ya Sauli na Samweli, ng’ombe zake watatendwa vivi hivi. Basi utisho wa BWANA ukawaangukia wale watu, wakatoka kama mtu mmoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
